  "description": "DRN.Framework.EntityFramework provides DrnContext with conventions to develop rapid and effective domain models.  \n  \n## Commit Info  \nAuthor: Duran Serkan  \nDate: 2026-11-19 22:44:23 +0300  \nHash: 08d1834aad59fddc366d9d45964489e1c1a6a4a8",
